<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence in northern Ethiopia is intensifying, with the WHO warning the health system is near collapse as attacks on civilians continue, including an RPG strike near a school in Moyale that killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers. Ethiopia is also conducting cross-border drone strikes, prompting Sudan to lodge formal complaints at the UN Security Council and the AU Peace and Security Council, while Kenya has begun registering over 50,000 Ethiopian refugees fleeing the Moyale clashes. The conflict has displaced 1.7 million people and affected an additional 173,000, according to UNHCR, and there were 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE50YUdFOTZZQ2ROVnp1eHFpYUt4QkhfbV9JRWNyNW5KaHFWWTc1UnNOekdsOUZ3X0VURmxkdzYxYktyU29lbDdwNEdOZnZEWU93VmZxajg0bw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNOVhwQlJBcU9JV0RiT055UDI1eGplR0pDUy1NN2ROSktzZFFZUE96cE9rT1RITm16UUZlVm4yWW9fa3lnUUpUS3IyUl95c09CaXJRazlJUjM1VGFlODBKYm1VN0dfOEJfYXl3NUlFTHVCMzBJWEJXUnV5eVdfTVVwVmZSSWlISXUxUENfRTREdnlFQ2gwN0RYQllJS2JpTG8xNWFVZUxVdHlxRkoxOUFvbk9xVHdXbzVFSWM2X1MxRTk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9pVmpvWENSdFlYeVh1S0tqNVRXRFlJa1MzYWNuc3JQcTNtSWVkdGVWQ3dsMURETUVzbmh4aEdtb0Ntbk5IZGRIMUFsRExGcE5HbFFUR1VGX2k?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTFBzNXl2YS1lOTAtNFNhT2JzZnVWamIwSUNCbnNSUFRVdnhncWF1RXBDSmhMTkYzZnlZRXRRQlQ1N2ZmOC1naUZrT3RwSU04VFJzb0d3